From eb5d4c14f3d447f13b94b855290472866c9b8772 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matteo Manicardi <manicardi.matteo87@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:19:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/19] diag(motion): 1.0.2-dev.8 P0 timing instrumentation on
 unified 539b646

Temporary DIAGNOSTIC candidate, never an operational candidate: the dev.8u
instrumentation of 0526cf6 (diag_0526cf6_over_200a3bd.diff, sha256
2e257677a1ec0a69..., be9198d counters unchanged) applied on 539b646 (STOP
re-arm 7878be0 + servo-conversion binding 539b646 on top of 4d4b797).
Only the BuildConfig comment names the new base. Not to be merged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8530d3a11ac9f25b4d39fc6811d6aa99564a54a5)
